\v 6 \w For the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [walked]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w forty| strong="H705" \w* \w years| strong="H8141" \w* \w in the wilderness| strong="H4057" \w*, \w till all the people| strong="H1471" \w* that were \w men| strong="H582" \w* \w of war| strong="H4421" \w*, [which came out]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*, [were consumed]{strong=“H8552” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [because they obeyed]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w not the voice| strong="H6963" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*: unto whom the \sc Lord\sc* [sware]{strong=“H7650” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [that he would not shew]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w them the land| strong="H776" \w*, which the \sc Lord\sc* [sware]{strong=“H7650” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w unto their fathers| strong="H1" \w* [that he would give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [us, a land]{strong=“H776”} [that floweth]{strong=“H2100” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w with milk| strong="H2461" \w* \w and honey| strong="H1706" \w*. 
