\v 2 And the \sc Lord\sc* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto Joshua| strong="H3091" \w*, [See]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [I have given]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w into thine hand| strong="H3027" \w* \w Jericho| strong="H3405" \w*, \w and the king| strong="H4428" \w* thereof, and \w the mighty men| strong="H1368" \w* \w of valour| strong="H2428" \w*. 
